<details class="admin-resource-intervention" id="colony-{{ planet.id }}"><summary>Corriger les ressources de {{ planet.name }}</summary>
<p class="admin-intervention-destination">Destination : {{ planet.name }} · {{ planet.coordinates() }} · {{ row.membership.universe.name }} · {{ player.username }}</p>
<p>Ajout ou retrait sur cette colonie uniquement. La correction entière est refusée si un stock devient négatif ou dépasse un entrepôt.</p>
<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_admin_player_resources',{id:player.id,planetId:planet.id}) }}" class="admin-intervention-form">
<input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('admin_resources_'~planet.id) }}"><input type="hidden" name="request_key" value="{{ stocks[planet.id].request_key }}">
<div class="admin-intervention-field">
    <label for="resource-operation-{{ planet.id }}">Type de correction</label>
    <select id="resource-operation-{{ planet.id }}" name="operation"><option value="add">Ajouter</option><option value="remove">Retirer</option></select>
</div>
<div class="admin-intervention-resources">
    {% for slug,stock in stocks[planet.id].resources %}
        <div class="admin-intervention-field">
            <label for="resource-{{ planet.id }}-{{ slug }}">{{ stock.label }}</label>
            <input id="resource-{{ planet.id }}-{{ slug }}" name="amounts[{{ slug }}]" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" required aria-describedby="resource-stock-{{ planet.id }}-{{ slug }}">
            <small id="resource-stock-{{ planet.id }}-{{ slug }}">Stock {{ stock.stock|quantity(2) }} / {{ stock.capacity|quantity(0) }}</small>
        </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
<div class="admin-intervention-field">
    <label for="resource-reason-{{ planet.id }}">Motif de la correction (obligatoire)</label>
    <textarea id="resource-reason-{{ planet.id }}" name="reason" maxlength="1000" required aria-describedby="resource-reason-limit-{{ planet.id }}"></textarea>
    <small id="resource-reason-limit-{{ planet.id }}">1 000 caractères maximum</small>
</div>
<label class="admin-intervention-confirm"><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="1" required> Je confirme les quantités, la colonie et le motif indiqués.</label>
<button class="primary" type="submit">Appliquer la correction</button></form></details>
